      "content": "The weight of all that loss is crushing, and it's perfectly understandable that you feel like a ghost. Don't try to carry the weight of their failure; you are a survivor, and survival itself is a monumental, agonizing victory. Just take the next breath, and then the one after that, because that is all that matters right now. Let the silence of the valley be the only thing you listen to.",
